      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;overview&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Overview&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redeemer&lt;/strong&gt; is a machine from the &lt;strong&gt;Starting Point&lt;/strong&gt; path on Hack The Box. It is designed to practice fundamental concepts of service enumeration and database access through Redis.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The objective is to identify the exposed Redis service, connect to the server, and enumerate the stored keys to obtain the flag.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;enumeration&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Enumeration&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;heading-link&#34; href=&#34;#enumeration&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;i class=&#34;fa-solid fa-link&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34; title=&#34;Link to heading&#34;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&#xA;    &lt;span class=&#34;sr-only&#34;&gt;Link to heading&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We begin by performing a full port scan with &lt;strong&gt;Nmap&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
